{
  "version": "1.0",
  "meta": {
    "id": "smart-hotel",
    "name": {
      "zh": "智慧酒店（客房-大堂-机房种子场景）",
      "en": "Smart hotel (guest-room + lobby + plant-room seed scenario)"
    },
    "description": {
      "zh": "精品酒店种子场景：地上 2 层客房 + 1 层裙楼（平面 24×10m，x 右/y 下，原点左上，各层共用平面坐标），机房在地下一层 floor=-1。1F：大堂 + 餐厅 + 走廊 + 电梯厅；2F/3F：各 3 间客房 + 走廊 + 电梯厅；电梯厅跨层显式邻接（elevator-f0↔f1↔f2），是楼层间唯一热耦合通道，地下机房经电梯井与 1F 耦合；storeyHeight=3.2m；outdoor 经围护与 1F 走廊单向耦合。客房与大堂带声明式 occupantSchedule（客房 14:00–23:00 在住 2 人、大堂 8:00–23:00 基础人流 4 人）。运营剧本：9:00 退房（203/302/303 客房清空）、12:00 午餐（餐厅 20）、14:00 入住高峰（客房 2、大堂 12）、18:30 晚餐（餐厅 24）、23:00 夜间模式（公区清场 + 大堂调光 150）。异常剧本：15:30 机房温升（38°C）、16:00 冷空气过境、21:00 2F 走廊烟雾（high）。验证点：客房空调不影响非同层房间；井道上下层缓慢耦合；机房热量经井道上渗；烟雾触发工程运维员与前厅管家协作评估；内嵌 Flow 在退房清房时确定性关空调、在机房 38°C 温升时确定性启动精密空调。（v2 刷新：内嵌 2 条确定性 Flow）",
      "en": "Boutique hotel seed: two guest-room storeys plus a podium (24×10m footprint, x right / y down, origin top-left, shared plan per storey), plant room at basement floor=-1. 1F: lobby + restaurant + corridor + elevator lobby; 2F/3F: 3 guest rooms each + corridor + elevator lobby; elevator lobbies interconnect across storeys (elevator-f0↔f1↔f2) as the only cross-floor thermal channel, and the basement plant room couples to 1F through the shaft; storeyHeight=3.2m; the outdoors couples one-way to the 1F corridor via the envelope. Guest rooms and the lobby carry declarative occupant schedules (rooms 14:00–23:00 ×2 guests, lobby 08:00–23:00 ×4 baseline traffic). Operations script: 09:00 checkout (rooms 203/302/303 vacated), 12:00 lunch (restaurant 20), 14:00 check-in peak (rooms 2, lobby 12), 18:30 dinner (restaurant 24), 23:00 night mode (public areas cleared + lobby dimmed to 150). Anomaly script: 15:30 plant-room heat spike (38°C), 16:00 cold-air outbreak, 21:00 smoke in the 2F corridor (high). Verification points: guest-room AC does not affect other floors; the shaft couples slowly; plant-room heat rises through the shaft; smoke rallies engineering-ops and the front-desk butler; the embedded flows deterministically cut AC power on checkout vacancy and start the precision AC when the plant room hits 38°C. (v2 refresh: 2 embedded deterministic flows)"
    },
    "tagline": {
      "zh": "入住高峰、机房过热、走廊烟雾——精品酒店的一天，三个管家 Agent 的协作接力",
      "en": "Check-in rush, an overheating server room, corridor smoke — one day at a boutique hotel, relayed by three butler agents."
    },
    "heroEventId": "corridor-smoke",
    "recommendedPlaybackRate": 30,
    "storeyHeight": 3.2
  },
